## Core Architecture
- `src/main.rs` — Entry point, spawns async tasks and bus listeners
- `src/bus/` — Central publish-subscribe message bus (std::sync::mpsc router thread)
- `src/cpu/` — Main execution engine + reasoning coordinator
- `src/io/` — Web server (Axum + WebSocket), Ollama handlers, Gemini handler, terminal, UNIX socket

## Subsystems
- `src/memory/` — Working + episodic + vector memory + beliefs
- `src/skills/` — Pluggable skill registry
- `src/hooks/` — Phase hooks (pre/post execution)
- `src/hy_evo/` — Evolutionary workflow engine
- `src/reasoning/` — Hypothesis → Plan → Execute loop (ReasoningEngine)
- `src/planning/` — Planner implementations
- `src/agents/` — Unified runtime loop (`RuntimeLoop`)
- `src/tools/` — Tool dispatcher + file/system/email tools

